Game Copyright Notice (Majesty HD)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an independent, fan-made Chinese localization ("translation
patch") for the video game "Majesty HD" (the Steam re-release of Majesty:
The Fantasy Kingdom Sim and its expansions). It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by the copyright holders of that game.

Majesty HD and all related titles, characters, artwork, music, and
trademarks are the property of their respective copyright holders,
including but not limited to:

    - Cyberlore Studios, Inc. (original developer)
    - Microprose / Infogrames / Atari (publishers)
    - Paradox Interactive (current publisher on Steam)

Copyright (c) their respective owners. All rights reserved.

This project distributes NO copyrighted game assets. It provides only
translation text and a runtime injection loader that users must apply to
their own legally acquired copies of the game. The game itself is not
redistributed by this project and remains governed by its own license.

